Note:

This manual has not been formatted to be printed out on a printer.  The
purpose of a text file version of this manual is to allow online access to
the manual.  This is a plain text translation from Soft Logic's Pageliner
and only minimal correction has been done to make this readable.

To truly appreciate the amount of work and effort which went into creating
this new manual, you should order the soft bound manual from CornerStone
Software.  All special text attributes and graphics have been removed to
make this text version of the manual as easy to read as possible.














































